<title>ITALY: Italy March industrial orders down 1.9 pct yr-yr.</title>
<headline>Italy March industrial orders down 1.9 pct yr-yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian industrial orders fell 1.9 percent year-on-year in March while turnover fell 1.1 percent, national statistics institute Istat said.</p>
</text>
